 "description": "Prepared (maximum defence, still beatable). Both lines are manned, every Zille mountain province holds mountain infantry, and this variant has the most armour and the biggest fleet. BUT Wiktor Smolak sent the best forces forward to seize Rizian territory: strike groups of adjacent tank/mechanized provinces stand next to the Rizian cities - Venna East 104 + Venna 20 (tanks) with 15 + 102 (mechanized) facing Mave Nortus; Dapalle Northwest 114 + Dapalle West 33 (tanks) with 29 + 26 (mechanized) facing Dapalle; Pomara West 117 + Pomara Northwest 36 on the Brivane road; Celle Vaz North 39 + Rivamare 38 (tanks) with Praia Velha 118 (mechanized) facing Celle Vaz / Marbelas; a second echelon (31, 110, 111, 25, 32) and paratroopers next to Zille City (30, 116). The capital Kratsna area and continental Wehlen keep only 6 units (militia and infantry, no armour), so a Rizian landing in the north or a breakthrough behind the strike groups can win.",
